@page "/components/select"

<PageTitle>Select — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Select</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A real <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>. There is no <code>SelectTrigger</code>,
    <code>SelectValue</code> or <code>SelectContent</code> — the native element is all three, and
    it brings the OS picker on a phone, type-ahead, and a form that posts with no script.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Basic</h2>
<Example Source="SelectBasic.razor"><SelectBasic /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Groups</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>&lt;optgroup&gt;</code> is the grouping, and its label is announced by the picker for
    free. Radix draws a <code>SelectGroup</code> and a <code>SelectLabel</code> to reproduce what
    the element already has.
</p>
<Example Source="SelectGroups.razor"><SelectGroups /></Example>

