<h2 class="doc-h2">Align Item With Trigger</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Radix aligns its panel with the chosen item so the current value stays under the pointer. That
    decision belongs to the operating system here, and each one makes it differently — macOS
    overlays the value, Windows drops below. It cannot be configured, and matching one would be
    wrong on the other.
</p>
<Example Source="SelectAlign.razor"><SelectAlign /></Example>

